# CLAUDE.md

This project uses the spec-driven-workflow plugin. See `.claude/workflow/state.json` for current phase.

## Context

@.claude/context/ARCHITECTURE.md
@.claude/context/PATTERNS.md
@.claude/context/DOMAIN.md
@.claude/context/TESTING.md

## Workflow

1. `/design <spec.md>` — produces a design doc, stops for human review
2. `/approve-design` — human gate, unlocks implementation
3. `/implement` — implements the approved design with tests
4. `/mark-reviewed` — human gate, unlocks finishing
5. `/finish` — changelog entry, commit, optional push/PR

Writes to source files are blocked by a hook until the design for the current
workflow state is approved; commits/pushes are blocked until code review is
marked complete. See `hooks/hooks.json` in the plugin if you need to debug why
something was blocked.
